## 1. Data Acquisition & Provenance Architecture

AccessLens-IE ingests **`{{raw_total_files}}`** real, public statistical exports (**`{{raw_total_bytes}}`** bytes total) with full cryptographic provenance recorded in [`outputs/audit/manifest.json`](../outputs/audit/manifest.json):

1. **HEA Student Records System (SRS) Public Releases (`2019/2020` to `2025/2026`):**
   * Extracted from the official HEA `Access our Data - Students` interactive portal (`https://hea.ie/statistics/data-for-download-and-visualisations/access-our-data/access-our-data-students/`, backed by `https://highereducationauthority.shinyapps.io/Enrolments_2026/`).
   * **`{{raw_hea_files}}` CSV files** covering all **`{{n_academic_years}}`** academic years (`2019/2020` through `2025/2026`):
     * Multi-year series by `Institute` (`tab1_Institute_by_year.csv`, **`{{hea_inst_csv_bytes}}`** bytes, SHA-256 prefix `{{hea_inst_csv_sha256_short}}`), `Programme Type`, `Age Group`, `Mode of Study`, `Field of Study`, `Course Level`, `Domicile Group`, `Gender`, and Irish-domiciled `County` (`tab1_County_IE_by_year.csv`, **`{{hea_cty_csv_bytes}}`** bytes, SHA-256 prefix `{{hea_cty_csv_sha256_short}}`).
     * Annual two-way cross-tabulations across each of the **`{{n_academic_years}}`** years for `Institute x Programme Type`, `Institute x Age Group`, `Institute x Mode of Study`, `Institute x Field of Study`, `Institute x Course Level`, and Irish-domiciled `County x Institute`.
2. **Pobal HP Deprivation Index Scores 2022 (Electoral Division Level, CC BY 4.0):**
   * Downloaded from `https://data.gov.ie/dataset/pobal-hp-deprivation-index-scores-2022` (`hp-deprivation-index-scores-2022.csv`, **`{{pobal_csv_bytes}}`** bytes, SHA-256 prefix `{{pobal_csv_sha256_short}}`).
   * Contains **`{{pobal_ed_count}}`** Electoral Divisions (EDs) across all **`{{n_counties}}`** counties of the Republic of Ireland, including embedded CSO Census 2022 total population (`TOTPOP22`, summing to **`{{pobal_total_pop_2022}}`** residents), relative deprivation score (`Index22_ED_std_rel_wt`), absolute deprivation score (`Index22_ED_std_abs_wt`), third-level education share (`EDHIGH22`), primary-only education share (`EDLOW_22`), lone parent ratio (`LONEPA22`), and male/female unemployment rates (`UNEMPM22`, `UNEMPF22`).

